STUB — replace this file with a real `icon.png` (128x128 PNG) before publishing.

Used only for GitHub social previews and package-search thumbnails; the npm
tarball explicitly excludes it (see `test/package.test.ts`).

To swap on your other machine:

```sh
mv assets/icon.png.stub assets/icon.png
# then drop the real icon at assets/icon.png
```

Spec: 128x128 PNG, transparent background, brand mark only.
Poolside reference: https://github.com/grikomsn/pi-provider-poolside/blob/main/assets/icon.png
